{"id":"vod_sn_36477","vodId":"36477","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"骷髅人","name_cn":"骷髅人","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第14集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/af2f08a51d0e409701998b9feec08f12.jpg"},"summary":"骷髅人的故事设定在一个“架空的时代”的“架空的日本”中，故事舞台则是一个在被称为“影之都”的巨大企业支配下的闭锁都市舞台。因远古秘宝骷髅头盔而拥有超能力的“反英雄”未知主角在这个架空的舞台上，在正义与邪恶、光明与黑暗、人类与非人类的瓜葛之间穿梭。作为黑暗英雄，一切的怜悯与同情都是多余的。骷髅人并非是善良的正义英雄，在向他露出獠牙之前请考虑清楚。 骷髅人到底是谁？这是本作品的一个特色，不到最后时刻是不会揭示骷髅人的真面目的。可能是主角？可能是貌似善良无能的神父？可能是大伴集团的骨干分子？可能是有名无实的警方？可能是路人A或提供情报者B？现在唯有等待动画中可能提供的线索或一直看到最后……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:43:31","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ttv36ZTdmb1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/m8CJsjaNZX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kymzeXgt1q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/J1B5QE6WYp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ec5thnCFRC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/T5r74tkjf11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fvQ3iR0YS01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sWN3c6F9Wn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ercytS7X121/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uXZrXDm4Yq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3AALc0TH9a1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/83DmWwcE6J1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/P9Y9WKv9Ar1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/54NgPkgQZ61/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"s